Hi Till,

Joint PWG/OP Summit will be VIRTUAL and also will be in *third* week of
May (Tue to Fri 17-20) as was decided back in November, but not correctly
posted until recently.

The IETF 113 Hybrid conference in Vienna, Austria (21-25 March) has less
than half the usual in-person attendees (and so is a financial disaster).
Both
3GPP and ETSI planned in-person meetings keep getting canceled and then
changed to virtual out into the late summer already.

There will not be any in-person PWG meeting in 2022.

Cheers,
- Ira

